sections.text:
The go-to formation for Infernal Shrines is 1-4:
1 Hero, the Offlaner, covers the top lane;
4 Heroes rotate between the middle and the bottom lane.

As shown in the image below, Infernal Shrines has a total of 5 Mercenary Camps:
2 Bruiser Camps (blue icon) in the top lane;
2 Siege Camps (green icon) in the middle lane;
1 Siege Camp (green icon) in the bottom lane.
Mercenary Camps on Infernal Shrines are always active,
even when a Shrine is up or when a Punisher is alive.
